burrow_all_default_s0.json is the BURROW pocket-detection model (preset "default", ranker "all", seed 0) of
BURROW 1.0.0 (package burrow-pockets, https://github.com/zoidpuff/burrow [set the final URL]), copied unchanged
from the BURROW release (models/, sha256 f33963e7e23f1d0b7fd352e89a2dc6b7be30f642cd09ba8644e1967af97c4315).
pocketcompare pins it so that fingerprints do not depend on where BURROW's models are installed.

